<title>USA: Hoke Cty, N.C., approves $4.5 million water GOs.</title>
<headline>Hoke Cty, N.C., approves $4.5 million water GOs.</headline>
<dateline>RAEFORD, N.C. 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Voters in Hoke County, N.C., approved a $4.5 million general obligation bond for the county water system, county elections officials said Wednesday.</p>
<p>The proposal passed with 1,314 yes votes and 472 no votes in Tuesday's balloting.</p>
<p>((--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013))</p>
</text>
